    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "對了，你剛才考的是甚麼大通？",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "UGD，愛情哲學。卷不太難。我是大通之鬼，這一科應該過得去。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "男人老狗修甚麼愛情哲學啊？難怪沒有朋友跟你一起修。",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "男人老狗就不可以修嗎？小姐你有性別歧視呀？",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "很少男孩子肯花精神去研究這個。追的時候一股勁追，追到手才發覺不知道喜歡人家甚麼，過不久就說性格不合，分了。",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "怎麼了？芷君姐姐。是不是你自己給不負責任的男孩子傷害過，所以才這麼說？",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "我才沒有這麼沒眼光！我看是你自己陷入了甚麼感情煩惱，所以才去修。",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "唉！要是感情煩惱可以單靠修一個課就解決得了的話，這個煩惱似乎也不見得嚴重得那裡去。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "怎麼了？真的有？修個課解決不了。告訴姐姐，讓姐姐賜你幾道板斧。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "好啊。不過你先告訴我，我才告訴你。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "告訴你甚麼？",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你自身的愛情故事。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "一隻麻雀落到桌面上。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "小明！怎麼了？你何時變得這麼八卦？竟然偷聽！",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "甚麼小明了？",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "這隻麻雀是眾志堂的老主顧。我叫牠小明。全名是「明明隔離枱面沒有人多的是冷飯剩菜偏偏不去吃硬是要到我們枱面偷飯吃的衰雀」，簡稱小明。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "嘻嘻，真是古靈精怪。",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "怎麼了？小明，你也想聽芷君姐姐說她的情史對不對？",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你別以為利用一隻麻雀便可以哄我說出來。",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "那姐姐要怎麼才肯說？",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "三餐飯。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "一餐好了。小明很窮的，窮到要討飯吃。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "兩餐。",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "好，小明請。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch09-story"
    }
  ]
}
